WEBVTT

00:02.640 --> 00:03.640
Your Highnesses

00:03.720 --> 00:04.880
Gentlemen

00:04.960 --> 00:06.360
Please

00:16.440 --> 00:18.320
The general guards the border for the state

00:18.400 --> 00:19.880
Throughout the court and country

00:19.960 --> 00:21.360
All hold you in high esteem

00:21.440 --> 00:23.360
Many students at the Imperial Academy

00:23.440 --> 00:25.360
Have written poems for the general

00:25.440 --> 00:27.200
If the general has the inclination

00:27.280 --> 00:29.200
Perhaps you could offer some comments

00:29.280 --> 00:30.680
I dare not comment

00:30.800 --> 00:32.467
But I can appreciate them
